  <decisions>
    <decision date="2026-10-06" by="owner">AI prompts on customer stamps are processed in the US Data Zone: every stamp OpenAI deployment uses SKU DataZoneStandard.</decision>
    <decision date="2026-10-06" by="agent, from evidence">gpt-4o-mini 2024-07-18 is Deprecating in westus3 (new deployments blocked — 2026-08-22 stand-up F1/O1), so the `gpt-4o-mini` and `spaarke-gpt4o-mini` deployment NAMES (which the BFF addresses) run gpt-4.1-mini 2025-04-14 (Legacy, retires 2027-04-14; same API shape, no BFF change). gpt-4o stays 2024-11-20 (Legacy, retires 2027-04-14). Fresh-sub DataZoneStandard auto-quota (demo/prod/dev, read 2026-10-06): gpt-4o 300, gpt4.1-mini 2000, text-embedding-3-large 1000 — covers 150 / 230 / 350.</decision>
    <decision date="2026-10-06" by="agent, from evidence">Stamps set AzureOpenAI__ChatModelName=gpt-4o-mini (per_env literal): without it AiModule skips the IChatClient registration (dev sets the same value).</decision>
  </decisions>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="owner 2026-10-06">Remove AutoRecompose completely (option + enum, interface, implementation, H2a step and ctor parameter, Worker registration, tests, skill text). Do not leave a no-op seam.</constraint>
    <constraint source="single source">The deployment rows and the default OpenAI region live in PinnedModelCatalog only; a test compares them with the compiled customer.json (openai deployments default + openAiLocation default) in both directions. openai.bicep stays the deployed truth — do not change what is deployed.</constraint>
    <constraint source="H0">TPM probe requests per model = sum of that model's deployment capacities; region = intake `openAiLocation` when set, else the catalog default. Pin-freshness probe uses the same region. Failing H0 behaviour (result shape, block on any model) is unchanged.</constraint>
    <constraint source="H12c">H12c writes one row per deployment NAME (sprk_name is the lookup key callers use) — never the underlying model id.</constraint>
    <constraint source="scope">No live Azure change; no BFF code change (one new per_env app setting). Deployment NAMES stay gpt-4o / gpt-4o-mini / spaarke-gpt4o-mini / text-embedding-3-large.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>Anything outside the listed files depends on OpenAiDeploymentSetPolicy or the recomposer (config, template, workflow) → STOP and report.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Remove AutoRecompose (constraint "owner").</step>
    <step order="2">PinnedModelCatalog: deployment rows + DefaultOpenAiLocation + RequestedTpmPerModel + region resolver; Models derived; forcing test against customer.json.</step>
    <step order="3">Probes: TPM probe uses the catalog's requested TPM + OpenAI region; freshness probe uses the OpenAI region; H0 declares openAiLocation as an optional input; tests updated (incl. negative: a run without openAiLocation queries westus3, not `region`).</step>
    <step order="4">PS script default + skill F5 text + plan G27/T247 + CHANGELOG.</step>
    <step order="5">Verify (ControlPlane.Tests, Worker build, ArchTests) + Step 9.5 + close + commit + push.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
    <output type="file-deleted">IOpenAiDeploymentSetRecomposer.cs, ArmOpenAiDeploymentSetRecomposer.cs, ArmOpenAiDeploymentSetRecomposerTests.cs</output>
    <output type="file-modified">PinnedModelCatalog.cs, both probes, H2a handler + options, Worker Program.cs, HandlerRunInputs.cs, tests, PS script, skill, plan, CHANGELOG</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`git grep -n -i "recompos\|OpenAiDeploymentSetPolicy" -- src scripts .claude/skills` returns nothing (CHANGELOG/history excepted).</criterion>
