    <criterion testable="true">TPM probe requests gpt-4o 150, gpt-4o-mini 230, text-embedding-3-large 350 and no text-embedding-3-small; with no openAiLocation it queries westus3, with openAiLocation=eastus2 it queries eastus2 (tests).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Pin-freshness probe checks gpt-4o 2024-11-20 in the OpenAI region (test).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">ControlPlane.Tests, Worker build and ArchTests pass; no new failures.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    COMPLETED 2026-10-06 (FULL rigor). Re-scoped with the owner from "make AutoRecompose real" (see decisions).

